Just got both Golem Unity and Engine of War Bunker in the same game. &nbsp;Team was:Argent Adept, (normal) Bunker, Omnitron-X, Unity vs. Baron Blade in the BlockBased on some stuff from the Steam forums, I thought that Bunker dying in the Block (where Fright Train is seen) was a good idea. &nbsp;I thought that Prison Riot might be a necessary component, but I never saw it, so I guess it isn&#39;t.&nbsp;I basically used AA and O-X to give Unity tons of card plays while Bunker used Grenade Launcher on various targets and stacked up the Omni-Cannon. &nbsp;Once Unity had a fleet of bots, I had Bunker Omni-Cannon himself and then I let Unity&#39;s bots start hitting herself to get her down to 6. &nbsp;Raptor bot won the game with a hit for 12 against the Baron.I started using O-X on The Block to try for Prison Riot, but never saw it (or apparently needed it).Prior to this game (based on advice from both forums) I lost 2 games against Iron Legacy using various Freedom Six team comps.

[/quote]

