Just did something similar and got the same unlocks.&nbsp;

Team was Ra, Tachyon, Bunker, Visionary, Unity vs. BB in the Block.

I had previously let Iron Legacy lay the smack down on the entire Freedom 6 less Tempest.&nbsp;

On the last turn, I had Tachy KO Bunker with a lightspeed barrage. Unity had all 5 Freedom Bots in play plus Mr. Chomps, and was at 5 HP. Mr. Chomps got the final hit, both Engine of War and Golem Unity unlocked.&nbsp;

Never saw Prison Riot, but did see Lock down.&nbsp;
